18:44:47.385 +2ms t0 LEGEND OPEN / OPEN_SLOT: a container screen opened, followed by every non-empty slot in it
18:44:47.385 +2ms t0 LEGEND SLOT: a slot changed between two ticks (old -> new); CURSOR: the item on the mouse changed; STATE: the menu's state id changed
18:44:47.385 +2ms t0 LEGEND CLOSE: the container screen closed; shows the menu's last known state (a click made in the same tick is included)
18:44:47.385 +2ms t0 LEGEND CLICK_RAW: a mouse press in the GUI, before the game handles it; KEY: a key press in the GUI
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND CLICK_SENT: the click the game is about to send to the server (slot, button, type) with the state before it
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND CLICK_PREDICTED: that same click after the client applied its own prediction, before the server has answered
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND PACKET_IN / PACKET_DONE: a container packet from the server just before / after the client applies it, with the client's state
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND MINION_CLICK: an armor stand was right-clicked (how a minion GUI is attributed to a physical minion)
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND TRACKER: a decision made by the minion fuel tracker; NOTE: a line added with /it guilog note
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND ITEMDEF: full data of one item fingerprint, written once before its first use
18:44:47.386 +3ms t0 LEGEND client state: screen, menu#containerId, stateId, slot 19 (the fuel slot) and the carried (cursor) item
